# WN22-DC-000070: Windows Server 2022 permissions on the Active Directory data files must only allow System and Administrators access.
# Source: Windows Server 2022 STIG r8
# Severity: high
# Generated from 01-extract/output/windows-server-2022-stig-r8-controls.json

META
    esp_id `win2022-wn22-dc-000070-001`
    version `1.0.0`
    dsl_schema_version `1.0.0`
    platform `windows`
    criticality `critical`

    title `Windows Server 2022 permissions on the Active Directory data files must only allow System and Administrators access.`
    description `Improper access permissions for directory data-related files could allow unauthorized users to read, modify, or delete directory data or audit trails. Satisfies: SRG-OS-000324-GPOS-00125, SRG-OS-000206-GPOS-00084`
    author `scanset-security`
    tags `windows,server-2022,stig,high,file-acl,ntfs,ksi-afr-scn,ksi-cna-mat,ksi-iam-jit,ksi-mla-ala,ksi-piy-rsd`

    control_mapping `KSI:KSI-AFR-SCN,KSI:KSI-CNA-MAT,KSI:KSI-IAM-JIT,KSI:KSI-MLA-ALA,KSI:KSI-PIY-RSD,NIST-800-53:AC-6(10),NIST-800-53:SI-11`
    control_objective `KSI-AFR-SCN,KSI-CNA-MAT,KSI-IAM-JIT,KSI-MLA-ALA,KSI-PIY-RSD`

    assessment_method `TEST`
    implementation_status `implemented`
    responsible_role `system-admin`

    control_origination `sp-system`
    inherited_from `Windows:server-2022:endpoint`
    customer_responsibility `configuration`

    remediation_days `1`
    recommendation `Maintain the permissions on NTDS database and log files as follows: NT AUTHORITY\SYSTEM:(I)(F) BUILTIN\Administrators:(I)(F) (I) - permission inherited from parent container (F) - full access`

    component_id `comp-windows-file-acl`

    impl_KSI_AFR_SCN `Windows Server implements KSI-AFR-SCN by asserting that the NTFS ACL on C:\Windows\NTDS does not grant any forbidden principal or rights combination, via Get-Acl through the windows_file_acl CTN. The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_KSI_CNA_MAT `Windows Server implements KSI-CNA-MAT by asserting that the NTFS ACL on C:\Windows\NTDS does not grant any forbidden principal or rights combination, via Get-Acl through the windows_file_acl CTN. The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_KSI_IAM_JIT `Windows Server implements KSI-IAM-JIT by asserting that the NTFS ACL on C:\Windows\NTDS does not grant any forbidden principal or rights combination, via Get-Acl through the windows_file_acl CTN. The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_KSI_MLA_ALA `Windows Server implements KSI-MLA-ALA by asserting that the NTFS ACL on C:\Windows\NTDS does not grant any forbidden principal or rights combination, via Get-Acl through the windows_file_acl CTN. The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_KSI_PIY_RSD `Windows Server implements KSI-PIY-RSD by asserting that the NTFS ACL on C:\Windows\NTDS does not grant any forbidden principal or rights combination, via Get-Acl through the windows_file_acl CTN. The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_AC_6_10 `Windows Server implements AC-6(10) by asserting that the NTFS ACL on C:\Windows\NTDS does not grant any forbidden principal or rights combination, via Get-Acl through the windows_file_acl CTN. The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`
    impl_SI_11 `Windows Server implements SI-11 by asserting that the NTFS ACL on C:\Windows\NTDS does not grant any forbidden principal or rights combination, via Get-Acl through the windows_file_acl CTN. The ESP scanner queries the policy via the windows_security_policy CTN and fails the policy if the value does not match the STIG-required state. Remediation sets the policy via secedit or Group Policy.`

META_END

DEF
    OBJECT target
        path `C:\Windows\NTDS`
    OBJECT_END

    STATE exists_check
        exists boolean = true
    STATE_END

    STATE forbid_id_1
        allow_identities string not_contains `Users`
    STATE_END

    STATE forbid_id_2
        allow_identities string not_contains `Everyone`
    STATE_END

    STATE forbid_id_3
        allow_identities string not_contains `Anonymous`
    STATE_END

    STATE forbid_id_4
        allow_identities string not_contains `Guest`
    STATE_END

    STATE forbid_id_5
        allow_identities string not_contains `INTERACTIVE`
    STATE_END

    STATE forbid_id_6
        allow_identities string not_contains `Authenticated`
    STATE_END

    STATE forbid_id_7
        allow_identities string not_contains `NETWORK SERVICE`
    STATE_END

    CRI AND
        CTN windows_file_acl
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF exists_check
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
        CTN windows_file_acl
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF forbid_id_1
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
        CTN windows_file_acl
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF forbid_id_2
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
        CTN windows_file_acl
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF forbid_id_3
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
        CTN windows_file_acl
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF forbid_id_4
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
        CTN windows_file_acl
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF forbid_id_5
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
        CTN windows_file_acl
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF forbid_id_6
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
        CTN windows_file_acl
            TEST all all AND
            STATE_REF forbid_id_7
            OBJECT_REF target
        CTN_END
    CRI_END
DEF_END
